{"seq":2,"slug":"the-birth-of-the-turing-machine","title":"图灵机的诞生","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/major-works/on-computable-numbers/the-birth-of-the-turing-machine","wordCount":1923,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"图灵机的诞生\">图灵机的诞生</h1><p>在一九三六年的论文《论可计算数》中，图灵为了给&quot;机械步骤&quot;一个精确定义，构造了一台抽象机器。论文里他称之为&quot;自动机&quot;（a-machine），&quot;图灵机&quot;这一名称是邱奇在一九三七年评论此文时所赋予（来源：<a href=\"https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/turing-machine/\">Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy: Turing Machines</a>）。本篇聚焦这台机器的<strong>内部构造、形式定义与&quot;通用机&quot;思想</strong>；论文的整体问题与历史定位见 <a href=\"the-1936-paper\">一九三六年的论文</a>，此处不重复判定问题的论证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本篇的核心论断：<strong>图灵机把&quot;什么叫机械计算&quot;从直觉变成了精确的数学对象，而它之所以可信，恰恰在于它被削减到不能再简。</strong> 理解它要抓住三点。</p>\n<p>其一是<strong>极简即普适</strong>。图灵刻意只保留纸带、读写头、符号表、有限状态与转移规则——任何多余能力都会让&quot;划界&quot;的论证失去普适性。简到极处，反而能覆盖一切&quot;能被机械执行的计算&quot;。其二是<strong>程序即数据</strong>。单台机器只能干一件事，真正的革命是通用图灵机：把另一台机器的描述编码成符号串写在纸带上，即可逐步模拟它，于是&quot;硬件固定、行为由软件决定&quot;。其三是<strong>模型的边界即机器的边界</strong>。&quot;永远停不下来&quot;不是缺陷，而是停机问题不可判定性的根源——正是这一看似简陋的设定，让计算有了硬上限。</p>\n<p>由此得到一条判断力：图灵机不是性能模型，而是<strong>界定&quot;可计算&quot;边界的工具</strong>。嫌它慢、用纸带做内存效率差，都是把工具用错了地方。邱奇—图灵论题则把这一模型升格为公理性基石：所有被提出的合理计算模型，最终都被证明与它等价。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[为何极简:&lt;br/&gt;多余能力会破坏划界的普适性] --&gt; B[部件: 纸带 读写头 符号表 状态 转移规则]&#10;    B --&gt; C[单台机器: 一个任务]&#10;    B --&gt; D[通用机 U: 读程序即数据 模拟任意机器]&#10;    D --&gt; E[程序与数据同居一处内存]&#10;    E --&gt; F[存储程序计算机的理论原型]&#10;    B --&gt; G[永不停机不是缺陷&lt;br/&gt;而是停机问题不可判定的根源]\">flowchart TD\n    A[为何极简:&lt;br/&gt;多余能力会破坏划界的普适性] --&gt; B[部件: 纸带 读写头 符号表 状态 转移规则]\n    B --&gt; C[单台机器: 一个任务]\n    B --&gt; D[通用机 U: 读程序即数据 模拟任意机器]\n    D --&gt; E[程序与数据同居一处内存]\n    E --&gt; F[存储程序计算机的理论原型]\n    B --&gt; G[永不停机不是缺陷&lt;br/&gt;而是停机问题不可判定的根源]</pre><h2 id=\"一台机器的全部零件\">一台机器的全部零件</h2><p>图灵刻意把机器削减到不能再简的程度，因为他要论证的是&quot;计算的本质&quot;，任何多余的能力都会让论证失去普适性。一台图灵机只由以下部件构成：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部件</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>物理类比</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纸带（tape）</td>\n<td>一维、向两端无限延伸、分格</td>\n<td>无限长的草稿纸</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>读写头（head）</td>\n<td>当前停在某格，可读、可写、可左右移一格</td>\n<td>笔尖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>符号表（alphabet）</td>\n<td>有限个可写符号，含空白符</td>\n<td>笔能写的字</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>状态（state）</td>\n<td>有限个&quot;心境&quot;，含起始态与停机态</td>\n<td>计算者当时在想什么</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转移规则（transition）</td>\n<td>由&quot;当前状态 + 当前符号&quot;决定&quot;写什么、往哪移、转到哪个状态&quot;</td>\n<td>一本死板的操作手册</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>图灵的灵感来自对&quot;一个人在做算术&quot;的极简抽象：人看一格、按规则改写、移动注意力、转换心境。把这个过程剥到只剩机械成分，就是图灵机。这一&quot;模仿人类计算者&quot;的出发点，正是他日后在 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/machine-intelligence/the-imitation-game\">模仿游戏</a> 中再次施展的思维手法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"形式定义\">形式定义</h2><p>用现代记号，一台（确定型）图灵机是一个七元组：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>δ</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>accept</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>q</mi><mtext>reject</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M = (Q,\\ \\Sigma,\\ \\Gamma,\\ \\delta,\\ q_0,\\ q_{\\text{accept}},\\ q_{\\text{reject}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">accept</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reject</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是有限状态集，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是输入字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>⊇</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma \\supseteq \\Sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⊇</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Σ</span></span></span></span></span> 是带字母表（含空白符 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⊔</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqcup</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">⊔</span></span></span></span></span>），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是起始状态。核心是转移函数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟶</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>Q</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>L</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta : Q \\times \\Gamma \\;\\longrightarrow\\; Q \\times \\Gamma \\times \\{L, R\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6943em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟶</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它读入&quot;当前状态、当前符号&quot;，输出&quot;新状态、要写的符号、读写头移动方向（左/右）&quot;。整台机器的运行就是反复套用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>δ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span></span></span></span></span>，直到进入停机状态——或者永远停不下来。&quot;永远停不下来&quot;这件事看似缺陷，却正是 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/computability/the-halting-problem\">停机问题</a> 不可判定性的根源。</p>\n<p>下图展示一台把二进制数末位加一的微型图灵机的状态流转：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; 右移到末尾&#10;  右移到末尾 --&gt; 右移到末尾: 读到0或1 / 右移&#10;  右移到末尾 --&gt; 进位: 读到空白 / 左移&#10;  进位 --&gt; 完成: 读到0 / 写1, 停&#10;  进位 --&gt; 进位: 读到1 / 写0, 左移&#10;  进位 --&gt; 完成: 读到空白 / 写1, 停&#10;  完成 --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; 右移到末尾\n  右移到末尾 --&gt; 右移到末尾: 读到0或1 / 右移\n  右移到末尾 --&gt; 进位: 读到空白 / 左移\n  进位 --&gt; 完成: 读到0 / 写1, 停\n  进位 --&gt; 进位: 读到1 / 写0, 左移\n  进位 --&gt; 完成: 读到空白 / 写1, 停\n  完成 --&gt; [*]</pre><h2 id=\"通用图灵机-论文里埋下的种子\">通用图灵机：论文里埋下的种子</h2><p>图灵机最深远的构想不是单台机器，而是<strong>通用图灵机</strong>（Universal Turing Machine, UTM）。图灵证明：存在一台特定的机器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span>，只要把另一台机器 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 的&quot;描述&quot;（编码成符号串）连同 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 的输入一起写在纸带上，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span></span></span></span></span> 就能一步步<strong>模拟</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 的全部行为。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">U(\\langle M \\rangle, x) = M(x)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(⟨</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一构想的革命性在于它打破了&quot;一台机器干一件事&quot;的常识：机器的<strong>程序</strong>可以像数据一样被写在纸带上读取。这正是现代&quot;存储程序计算机&quot;（stored-program computer）的理论原型——程序与数据同居一处内存。冯·诺依曼在一九四五年的 EDVAC 报告中提出的体系结构，公认受此思想影响（来源：<a href=\"https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/turing-machine/\">Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy: Turing Machines</a>）。通用机如何成为真实计算机的蓝图，见 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/the-turing-machine/the-universal-machine\">通用机</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么这个模型-恰好够用-邱奇-图灵论题\">为什么这个模型&quot;恰好够用&quot;——邱奇–图灵论题</h2><p>一个自然的质疑：这么简陋的机器，凭什么说它能算&quot;一切可计算的东西&quot;？答案是经验性的&quot;邱奇–图灵论题&quot;——<strong>凡是直觉上可由机械步骤计算的函数，都可由图灵机计算</strong>。它不是定理（无法证明，因为&quot;直觉可计算&quot;没有形式定义），而是一条被反复验证的论断：λ 演算、递归函数、寄存器机、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span> 可定义性……所有人们提出的合理计算模型，最终都被证明与图灵机<strong>等价</strong>（来源：<a href=\"https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/church-turing/\">SEP: The Church-Turing Thesis</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>计算模型</th>\n<th>提出者 / 年代</th>\n<th>与图灵机的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>λ 演算</td>\n<td>邱奇，1936</td>\n<td>等价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一般递归函数</td>\n<td>哥德尔–埃尔布朗，1934</td>\n<td>等价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>寄存器机</td>\n<td>后人</td>\n<td>等价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>现代编程语言</td>\n<td>至今</td>\n<td>图灵完备即等价</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种&quot;殊途同归&quot;是论题可信的根基：今天说一种语言&quot;图灵完备&quot;，就是说它的计算能力恰好等于图灵机。</p>\n<h2 id=\"权衡与反模式\">权衡与反模式</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>权衡：极简换普适。</strong> 图灵机慢得离谱、用纸带做内存效率极差，但它不是用来跑程序的，而是用来<strong>界定&quot;可计算&quot;的边界</strong>。把它当性能模型是用错了工具。</li>\n<li><strong>反模式一：以为图灵机&quot;造出来过&quot;。</strong> 它是数学对象，纸带的无限长在物理上不可实现；真实计算机是有限近似。</li>\n<li><strong>反模式二：把通用机等同于&quot;功能多&quot;。</strong> 通用性的要害是&quot;程序可被当作数据处理&quot;，而非&quot;功能丰富&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>反模式三：把图灵完备当褒义堆砌。</strong> 连 Excel 公式、某些卡牌游戏都被证明图灵完备——它只说明&quot;能算的都能算&quot;，不保证好用或高效。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>图灵机是图灵为给&quot;机械步骤&quot;一个精确定义而构造的抽象机器，刻意削减到不能再简，以保证划界的普适性。</li>\n<li>它的全部部件是纸带、读写头、符号表、有限状态与转移规则；运行就是反复套用转移函数 δ。</li>\n<li>通用图灵机把程序当作数据来读取并模拟任意机器，是&quot;存储程序计算机&quot;的理论原型。</li>\n<li>&quot;永不停机&quot;这一设定不是缺陷，而是停机问题不可判定性的根源。</li>\n<li>它的用途是界定&quot;可计算&quot;而非衡量性能；邱奇—图灵论题把这一模型升格为公理性基石。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：作为计算模型的系统论述见 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/the-turing-machine/a-model-of-computation\">一种计算的模型</a>；可计算性的边界见 <a href=\"../../ideas-and-methods/computability/the-limits-of-computation\">计算的极限</a>；图灵机如何奠基整门学科见 <a href=\"../../core-contributions/founding-computer-science/theoretical-foundations\">理论基础</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"参考来源\">参考来源</h2><ul>\n<li>Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy，Turing Machines（命名、定义、通用机）：<a href=\"https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/turing-machine/\">https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/turing-machine/</a></li>\n<li>Stanford Encyclopedia of Philosophy，The Church-Turing Thesis：<a href=\"https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/church-turing/\">https://plato.stanford.edu/entries/church-turing/</a></li>\n<li>论文全文（ETH Zürich 存档）：<a href=\"https://people.math.ethz.ch/~halorenz/4students/Literatur/TuringFullText.pdf\">https://people.math.ethz.ch/~halorenz/4students/Literatur/TuringFullText.pdf</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图灵机的诞生","id":"图灵机的诞生"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"一台机器的全部零件","id":"一台机器的全部零件"},{"level":2,"text":"形式定义","id":"形式定义"},{"level":2,"text":"通用图灵机：论文里埋下的种子","id":"通用图灵机-论文里埋下的种子"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么这个模型\"恰好够用\"——邱奇–图灵论题","id":"为什么这个模型-恰好够用-邱奇-图灵论题"},{"level":2,"text":"权衡与反模式","id":"权衡与反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"参考来源","id":"参考来源"}],"prev":{"title":"一九三六年的论文","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/major-works/on-computable-numbers/the-1936-paper"},"next":{"title":"一九五〇年的论文","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/alan-turing/major-works/computing-and-intelligence/the-1950-paper"}}